---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Studio Ravya"
  description="Studio Ravya terms of service governing website use, consulting engagements, proposals, and intellectual property ownership."
>
  <div class="max-w-[820px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-24">
    <header class="mb-12">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-primary block mb-2">Legal &amp; Trust</span>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-on-surface font-normal mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-outline font-mono">Last updated: March 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="font-sans text-sm sm:text-base text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed space-y-8">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-on-surface font-normal">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing and using this website, or engaging Studio Ravya for digital design and engineering services, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and any formal Statement of Work (SOW) executed between the parties.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-on-surface font-normal">2. Client Engagement &amp; SOW</h2>
        <p>
          Specific project deliverables, milestones, payment schedules, and warranties are governed by individualized Statements of Work. In the event of a conflict between these Terms and an executed SOW, the SOW shall supersede.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-on-surface font-normal">3. Intellectual Property Ownership</h2>
        <p>
          Upon full settlement of agreed project invoices, the client receives 100% ownership of custom final code, design assets, and creative deliverables created for their specific build. Studio Ravya retains the right to display completed non-confidential work in our portfolio.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-on-surface font-normal">4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, Studio Ravya shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from third-party hosting outages, DNS issues outside our direct control, or software modifications made by unauthorized third parties post-launch.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-on-surface font-normal">5. Governing Law &amp; Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Any disputes arising out of these terms shall be resolved through good-faith negotiation. For legal inquiries, please contact <a href="mailto:contact@studioravya.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">contact@studioravya.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
